      <link>https://www.farmersweekly.co.za/agri-news/south-africa/wool-industry-opens-the-door-for-accurate-carbon-reporting/#utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=wool-industry-opens-the-door-for-accurate-carbon-reporting</link>
      <description>A new peer-reviewed study has found that wool production is not as carbon-intensive as believed and could help curb global warming. This scientific proof is the first step in re-establishing wool’s value as a sustainable fibre and boosting market acceptance.</description>
